# Rust
/target
**/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# Env / secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa
id_ed25519
# Prefer explicit names — avoid unanchored *secret* / *credentials* globs
# that can hide legitimate source files.
**/secrets/
**/credentials/
**/*secrets*.toml
**/*credentials*.toml
**/.codex/auth.json
auth.json

# Local config that may contain API keys (keep examples if added later)
**/config.local.toml
**/.selara/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo

# Node / Tauri frontend (also covered under apps/selara-desktop/.gitignore)
node_modules/
